	(descr "0603 (1608 metric, 1.6 x 0.8 mm) MLCC GRM188 / CL10. IPC-7351C least density (D109): lands 0.65 x 0.80 at +-0.625 (gap 0.60, overall 1.90 x 0.80). Chip 1.6 x 0.8, tolerance taken as +-0.20 (worst case of the high-capacitance 22 uF GRM188C80J226ME15D / Samsung CL10A226MQ8NRNC codes; +-0.10 on standard GRM188): toe 0.15 past the nominal end, 0.05 at L max 1.80; land inner edge 0.30 (terminal inner edge 0.25 at g min 0.50, heel -0.05 = IPC L); width 0.80 (= W nominal, kept for the D108 microvias + current). Murata GR*18 Table 2: a 0.6-0.8 -> 0.60, b 0.6-0.7 -> 0.65, c 0.6-0.8 -> 0.80. Courtyard 2.10 x 1.00. Derived from lib:C_0603_1608Metric_W (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/C_0603_1608Metric_L.json")
